                  "content": "Fixed set, always rendered in this canonical order. Each category owns one glyph and one colour pair: a solid accent for icons, text and bar fills, and a soft wash for tiles and chips. Hues are spread so that no two neighbours in the canonical order sit closer than ~45°, and the mix bar adds a hairline gap between segments so even the two closest hues (Shopping / Life & Entertainment) stay separable at 5 px.",
